&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role (what you&#39;ll be doing)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Marketing Analytics Analyst to help build a best-in-class marketing measurement function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits between Marketing, Product and Data, helping ensure our marketing decisions are driven by accurate, trusted data rather than assumptions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across SQL, marketing platforms, tracking, experimentation and reporting to improve our understanding of customer acquisition, attribution and commercial performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting the Director of Marketing Analytics in delivering the company&#39;s marketing measurement and analytics strategy. You will help maintain our marketing data infrastructure, investigate data issues, build reporting, support experimentation and generate insights that improve marketing efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Marketing Performance Analytics&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce reporting across paid marketing channels including Meta, Google, TikTok and other acquisition platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor over-arching marketing reporting to identify opportunities to improve efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse trends in spend, CAC, conversion rates, retention and LTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support marketing teams with ad hoc analysis and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Marketing Data &amp;amp; SQL&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write SQL queries to investigate marketing performance and customer behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate marketing data across BigQuery, advertising platforms and internal systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable datasets that improve reporting consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain reliable marketing data models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracking &amp;amp; Measurement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with implementation and validation of marketing tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate discrepancies between internal reporting and marketing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate events across Segment, GA4 and advertising pixels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support testing of new tracking implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Attribution &amp;amp; Customer Journey&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse customer journeys from first visit through to conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support attribution reporting across marketing channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help improve measurement frameworks for paid media performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Stakeholder Support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Marketing, Product and Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate analytical findings into clear business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce dashboards and reports for both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document analytical processes and measurement methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you (who you are)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Essential&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Meta, Google Ads and/or TikTok Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience analysing marketing or digital product data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with large unstructured datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to explain technical findings clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with BigQuery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GA4.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or maintaining dbt models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Segment or similar CDPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of APIs and marketing data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with A/B testing or experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is also behind a growing family of digital healthcare clinics (Pilot, Kin, Software, Compound) across men&#39;s health and well-being, fertility, skincare, and preventative health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here&#39;s what makes joining Euc unique:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s next:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;our goal for the next three years is to support 1 million patients globally to live better for longer. We&#39;re launching into new conditions, demographics and geographies as we build a truly preventive healthcare ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something world-changing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;we&#39;re on the path to becoming the world&#39;s largest international digital healthcare company. It will be challenging, fast-paced and deeply rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;you&#39;ll deliver work that directly shapes patient outcomes and scales evidence-based care across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your growth:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;you&#39;ll have high ownership, continuous feedback and dedicated development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a motivated team:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;you&#39;ll collaborate with talented peers to solve complex clinical and operational problems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s ahead in the UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in your growth:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;annual development budget plus 3 days of professional development leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work flexibly:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;hybrid setup with 3 days a week in our Old Street office, designed for focus and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your well-being:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;private health insurance through Vitality, or opt for a monthly wellness allowance to spend on what matters most to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take time off:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;25 days of holiday, enhanced parental leave, and work from anywhere 3 weeks out of the year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a connected team:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;a vibrant office culture with regular socials, clubs, after-school sport and seasonal events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;seeking&amp;nbsp;a skilled and motivated Software Quality Engineer to join our Mission Assurance team. This role sits at the intersection where software quality meets in-orbit operations, offering the opportunity to drive the operational performance of a satellite constellation. The role has two&amp;nbsp;facets, you will own software quality assurance activities across the development lifecycle&amp;nbsp;and also&amp;nbsp;provide quality oversight to the team&amp;nbsp;operating&amp;nbsp;our constellation of satellites during commissioning, operations, and anomaly response. As the company implements its development roadmap, the distinction between these two aspects will blur with satellite operations increasingly transitioning to automated AI/ML tools to manage the fleet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate combines a rigorous, process-driven approach to software quality with an analytical mindset and operational awareness to allow them to ensure on-orbit anomalies are investigated and resolved effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a broad remit, so&amp;nbsp;previous&amp;nbsp;experience in both areas is not&amp;nbsp;required. For example,&amp;nbsp;a strong software QA background in a demanding industry (e.g. banking, medical, defence) will&amp;nbsp;likely also&amp;nbsp;have developed the analytical mindset needed to investigate on orbit issues. You will work closely with a fantastic team of software engineers, systems engineers, technical experts and spacecraft operators to ensure that our software and satellites are fit for purpose and that deviations from expected behaviour are understood, reported, assessed, and resolved with sound engineering judgment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;Do as Software &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Satellite Operations&amp;nbsp;Quality Engineer:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Quality Assurance (Primary Focus):&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;software QA processes, standards, and acceptance criteria for onboard and ground segment software across the full development lifecycle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that software verification and validation activities are comprehensive and correctly executed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the Software Development Lifecycle meets applicable quality requirements and standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where situations require deviation from defined process, ensure that this is performed safely and in a controlled manner.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise, track, and manage non-conformances, ensuring corrective and preventive actions are&amp;nbsp;identified&amp;nbsp;and implemented effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure risks are&amp;nbsp;identified,&amp;nbsp;evaluated&amp;nbsp;and communicated effectively to the project and management team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that&amp;nbsp;the software configuration baseline&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;maintained&amp;nbsp;throughout development and mission lifetimes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confirm all software releases are reviewed and compliant to standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to process improvement initiatives and ensure compliance with applicable standards (e.g.&amp;nbsp;ISO 29110, ECSS-Q-ST-80, ECSS-E-ST-40, or&amp;nbsp;equivalent).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Satellite Operations (SatOps) Anomaly Support:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide Mission Assurance support to satellite operations, especially during critical mission phases such as Checkout and Commissioning, In-Orbit&amp;nbsp;Verification&amp;nbsp;and anomaly response.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and contribute to anomaly investigations, root cause analyses, and failure review boards, ensuring findings are well-documented and lessons are captured.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the mission impact of anomalies is&amp;nbsp;assessed&amp;nbsp;and operational workarounds, corrective actions and recovery steps are&amp;nbsp;appropriate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify&amp;nbsp;links between incidents and coordinate response to common anomalies across the fleet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure lessons learned are fed back to satellite development teams using non-conformance and corrective action processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with software development, systems engineering and satellite operations teams to continually improve satellite operations tooling, improving Fault Detection, Isolation and Recovery (FDIR), increasing automation and raising the availability of the satellite fleet through transition to AI/ML based systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the mission assurance interface to the operations team, software engineers, and systems engineers during anomaly investigations and resolution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc or MEng in Aerospace Engineering, Computer Science, Systems Engineering, or a related technical discipline.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a software QA, systems engineering, or mission assurance role within a highly regulated industry (e.g. aerospace, defence, banking, medical).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of contributing to investigations and fault finding of complex systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with version control systems (e.g. Git) and issue tracking tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of software development lifecycles (Agile and/or waterfall) and associated QA activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and concise communicator, able to present technical findings to diverse audiences including management and non-specialist stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with FMEA, FDIR, hazard analysis, or other dependability and safety analysis methods.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with satellite operations or ground segment software in an operational environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting LEOP, commissioning, or in-orbit validation activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency&amp;nbsp;in scripting or data analysis for telemetry analysis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in configuration management in a regulated engineering environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with failure review boards or anomaly resolution in an operational setting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of relevant standards such as&amp;nbsp;ISO 29110, ECSS-Q-ST-80, ECSS-E-ST-40, or DO-178C.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spire operates a hybrid work model, and this position will require you to work a minimum of three days per week in the office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightClicked SCXW152905918 BCX0&quot;&gt;Access to US export-controlled software and/or technology may be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightClicked SCXW152905918 BCX0&quot;&gt;required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightClicked SCXW152905918 BCX0&quot;&gt; for this role. If needed, Spire will arrange the necessary licenses—this is not something candidates need to have before applying. &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;sub&gt;#LI-MK1&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Global Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛰️ Name Your Satellite Program (NYSP)&lt;br&gt;🚀 Launch Attendance&lt;br&gt;🌴 Generous Time Off Policy&lt;br&gt;🎓 Education Assistance Program&lt;br&gt;🥰 Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;br&gt;📈 Employee Stock Purchase Program (ESPP)&lt;br&gt;👣 Family Leave&lt;br&gt;💪 Fitness Reimbursement&lt;br&gt;🧡 Employee Referral Program&lt;br&gt;🍉 Healthy snacks &amp;amp; beverages in every office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Spire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;improve life on Earth with data from space.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
